Placeholder so `//go:embed all:frontend/dist` resolves on a clean checkout,
before the SPA has been built. The real assets (index.html, assets/*) are
produced by `pnpm build:client` and are git-ignored.

Committed in two places on purpose. Vite's `emptyOutDir` wipes frontend/dist on
every build -- including the build `wails dev` runs at startup -- which used to
delete the tracked copy and leave a deletion in `git status` after every run.
The copy under frontend/public/ is what prevents that: Vite copies publicDir
into the output on each build, so the tracked file is restored byte-identical
and the working tree stays clean. Keep the two copies in sync.
